    <div class="side-box message-box emergency-message-box oc-emergency-severity-30 " >
   <h3 class="side-box-title">Labour Day closure arrangements</h3>
   <div class="side-box-content">
      <p >Narrandera Shire Council's offices, works depot and library will be closed on Monday 5 October 2026 for the Labour Day holiday. For emergencies, contact our after hours numbers.</p>
      <a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Council/Contact-us"  target="_self" >Contact us</a>
      
   </div>
