	<a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Council/News-and-media/Media-releases/Grow-Our-Own-program-celebrates-further-expansion-with-Narrandera-Shire-Council-partnership" class="profile-list item-0 homepage-show" >		
		
       <picture>
  <source media="(min-width: 992px)" srcset="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/grow-our-own-program-celebrates-further-expansion-with-narrandera-shire-council-partnership/grow-own-own.png?dimension=homepagelisting&w=380&h=250">
  <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/grow-our-own-program-celebrates-further-expansion-with-narrandera-shire-council-partnership/grow-own-own.png?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=328">
  <source srcset="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/grow-our-own-program-celebrates-further-expansion-with-narrandera-shire-council-partnership/grow-own-own.png?dimension=homepagelisting&w=480&h=316">
  <img class="large-thumbnail-image" src="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/grow-our-own-program-celebrates-further-expansion-with-narrandera-shire-council-partnership/grow-own-own.png?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=328" alt=""/>
  </picture>
		<h2>Grow Our Own program celebrates further expansion</h2>
		<p class="published-on small-text">Published on 24 September 2026</p>
		<p>Grow Our Own, an industry-led alliance, broadens reach to connect Narrandera students and local industry, building on its work across the Western Riverina in previous years.</p>
	</a>
</div><div class="col-xs-12 col-m-6 col-lg-4">
	<a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Council/News-and-media/Media-releases/Koala-Festival-ends-with-a-big-win-for-Narranderas-koalas" class="profile-list item-1 homepage-show" >		
		
       <picture>
  <source media="(min-width: 992px)" srcset="/files/content/public/v/1/council/news-and-media/media-releases/koala-festival-ends-with-a-big-win-for-narranderas-koalas/_dsf4293.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=380&h=250">
  <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/files/content/public/v/1/council/news-and-media/media-releases/koala-festival-ends-with-a-big-win-for-narranderas-koalas/_dsf4293.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=328">
  <source srcset="/files/content/public/v/1/council/news-and-media/media-releases/koala-festival-ends-with-a-big-win-for-narranderas-koalas/_dsf4293.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=480&h=316">
  <img class="large-thumbnail-image" src="/files/content/public/v/1/council/news-and-media/media-releases/koala-festival-ends-with-a-big-win-for-narranderas-koalas/_dsf4293.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=328" alt=""/>
  </picture>
		<h2>Koala Festival ends with a big win for Narrandera's koalas</h2>
		<p class="published-on small-text">Published on 21 September 2026</p>
		<p>This year, 200 participants of the Annual Koala Count at the Narrandera Koala Festival, counted 49 koalas including 5 joeys, contributing to what has become a remarkable conservation success story.</p>
	</a>
</div><div class="col-xs-12 col-m-6 col-lg-4">
