       <picture>
  <source media="(min-width: 992px)" srcset="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/nominations-open-for-the-2027-narrandera-shire-australia-day-awards/picture1.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=380&h=250">
  <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/nominations-open-for-the-2027-narrandera-shire-australia-day-awards/picture1.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=328">
  <source srcset="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/nominations-open-for-the-2027-narrandera-shire-australia-day-awards/picture1.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=480&h=316">
  <img class="large-thumbnail-image" src="/files/content/public/v/2/council/news-and-media/media-releases/nominations-open-for-the-2027-narrandera-shire-australia-day-awards/picture1.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=328" alt=""/>
  </picture>
		<h2>Nominations open for the 2027 Narrandera Shire Australia Day Awards</h2>
		<p class="published-on small-text">Published on 18 September 2026</p>
		<p>Narrandera Shire Council is calling on the community to nominate local people and organisations who have made a difference to the Narrandera Shire.</p>
	</a>
