	<a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Council/News-and-media/Public-notices/Labour-Day-closure-arrangements" class="profile-list item-0 homepage-show">	
		<h2>Labour Day closure arrangements</h2>
		 
   
      <p class="on-display-until small-text"><span class="display-text">On display until </span>
   
    

<span class="display-date">06 October 2026</span></p>
          
		<p >Narrandera Shire Council advises that the Administration Centre, Narrandera Library, Community Services Building, Works Depot and Waste Facilities will be closed on Monday 5 October 2026 in observance of the Labour Day public holiday.</p>
	</a>
</div>
        
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-m-6 col-lg-4">
	<a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Council/News-and-media/Public-notices/Slowed-traffic-notice-Barellan" class="profile-list item-1 homepage-show">	
		<h2>Slowed traffic notice - Barellan</h2>
		 
   
      <p class="on-display-until small-text"><span class="display-text">On display until </span>
   
    

<span class="display-date">03 October 2026</span></p>
          
		<p >Council advises that slow-moving traffic and short delays can be expected between 11am and 1pm on Friday 2 October 2026, due to the Good Old Days Festival parade.</p>
	</a>
</div>
        
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-m-6 col-lg-4">
	<a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Council/News-and-media/Public-notices/Roadworks-notice-Weerona-Road" class="profile-list item-2 homepage-show">	
		<h2>Roadworks notice - Weerona Road</h2>
		 
   
      <p class="on-display-until small-text"><span class="display-text">On display until </span>
   
    

<span class="display-date">15 October 2026</span></p>
          
		<p >Council will commence roadworks on Weerona Road, Landervale on Thursday 24 September.</p>
	</a>
</div>
        
        </div>
</div>
<a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Public-notices" class="panel-button">View More Public Notices</a></div>
        
        
    
</div>
          <div class="no-js-element clearfix tabs-header for-panel-3 tab-type-default ">
    <h1 class="item-text" >Have your say</h1>
</div>
<div id="panel-3" class="tabs-panel clearfix tab-type-default ">
    <div class="wysiwyg-content body-content" ><p>Council invites community feedback on policies, plans, strategies and other documents&nbsp;on public exhibition. Development applications may also be exhibited for public feedback if required.</p>
<p>When matters are open for exhibition, the documents can be viewed here on the website or at Council's Business Administration building.&nbsp;Please remember to provide written submission prior to the closing date.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.narrandera.nsw.gov.au/Council/News-and-media/Have-your-say" class="styled-button">View exhibition items here</a></p>

</div>
    
    
</div><div class="no-js-element clearfix tabs-header for-panel-4 tab-type-default ">
    <h1 class="item-text" >Events</h1>
</div>
<div id="panel-4" class="tabs-panel clearfix tab-type-default ">
    <div class="wysiwyg-content body-content" ><p><div class="oc-quick-list oc-quick-list-grid oc-quick-list-grid-2 landing-page-list-container clearfix"><div class="grid" role="list"><div class="col-xs-12 col-m-4" role="listitem">
	<div class="list-item-container small-panel" >		
