	<ul class="footer-links without-icons ">   </ul>
	<p>Narrandera Shire Council respectfully acknowledges the Wiradjuri/Wiradyuri People as the traditional custodians of the land and waters of our area. We pay respect to Elders past, present and emerging, and extend that respect to other Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people living in and visiting the Narrandera Shire.</p>


